<#GAPDoc Label="example_smallclassnrgroup">
<Example><![CDATA[
gap> SmallClassNrGroup( 4, 4 );
<pc group of size 12 with 3 generators>
gap> G := SmallClassNrGroup( 4, 4 : AsPermGroup );
Group([ (1,2,3), (1,4,2) ])
gap> NrConjugacyClasses( G );
4
gap> IsAlternatingGroup( G );
true
]]></Example>


